                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 343.</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Fish to General Sickles</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 129.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1870-12-20"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 20, 1870.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> The following telegram was forwarded to you
                    on the 19th instant, through the United States legation at London.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>HAMILTON FISH.</signed></closer>


